      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "First I thought this was a hidden message from the manager saying, \"From now on, it doesn't matter if you are Quest or PCVR, you can post in the same category!\"\nCertainly, it was very chaotic and should have been fixed, with bug reports, Open Beta and Future Requests all jumbled together in just one category, \"Quest Creators\" for all this time.\nBut even if my guess was correct, it is still a great disappointment to lose all the ongoing submissions that had been submitted in the past and had received many votes.\nIn particular, the post \"Add constraint to the whitelist in Quest\", which was persistently requested and which the manager commented that he would consider in the future, especially needs to be reinstated.\nHere I propose two options.\n1. restore the category for Quest and create some new sub-categories (bug reports, requests, etc.) within it.\n2. close the Quest category and announce to the community that \"Quest and PC categories are now merged!\" \nWith both of options, I think rescuing lost posts is what the community is looking for.\nPlease consider it!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
